SuperShadersSuiteRT — License and Third-Party Notices
=====================================================

Universal post-processing, RT-lite lighting, and visual-preset addon for
UZDoom/GZDoom 4.10+ (hardware renderer). Distributed as a PK3/WAD
(SuperShadersSuiteRT.wad).

Forum: https://forum.zdoom.org/viewtopic.php?t=62772


