2. Third-party and bundled components
-------------------------------------

This addon bundles or adapts work from several community projects and shader
authors. Those portions remain under their original terms. Where a component
is marked "inspired" or "lite", it is a new implementation informed by the
named project — not a wholesale port — unless a file comment states otherwise.

Integrated / adapted (ship in this PK3)
-----------------------------------------

DarkDoomZ (sector darkness + flashlight)
  Author: Sterling "Caligari87" Parker
  License: zlib (see section 3.1)
  Files: Scripts/SSSDarkDoomHandler.zs, related CVARs/menus, SNDINFO flashlight sound

MariFX / MariENB GPU grading stack
  Author: Marisa Kirisame (OrdinaryMagician)
  Files: SHADERS/glsl/mfx_*.fp, MariFXHandler and related CVARs/menus in zscript.zc
  Note: Shader headers credit (C)2012–2021 Marisa Kirisame. GIMP hue/saturation
        filter portions credit Michael Natterer (C)2007. Retain upstream notices
        in shader sources.

VHS & CRT post-process shader
  Author: DRON12261 (VHS & CRT Shader Mod for GZDoom)
  License: GNU GPL v3.0 (see section 3.3)
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/VHSCRTShader.fp, Scripts/VHSCRTPostProcessHandler.zs,
         VHSCRT options menu
  Upstream: https://github.com/dron12261games/MOD-VHS-CRT-Shader-by-DRON12261
  ShaderToy sources credited upstream: Timothy Lottes (FixingPixelArt), Vladimir
        Storm (VHS tape noise), Gaktan (VHS tape effect)

Vignette post-process
  Port: Nash Muhandes
  Original shader: Ippokratis (ShaderToy lsKSWR)
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/Vignette.fp, vignette handling in zscript.zc

Film grain post-process
  Author: Martins Upitis (martinsh)
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (see section 3.2)
  Files: SHADERS/FilmGrain.fp
  Perlin noise portion: toneburst (machinesdontcare.wordpress.com)

Fisheye post-process
  Based on ShaderToy view 4sSSzz
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/Fisheye.fp, FishEyePostProcessHandler.zs

Filmic tonemap LUT shader
  Credits: kingeric1992 (ENB Series forum)
  Files: SHADERS/FilmicTonemap.fp (and legacy FilmicTonemap_old*.fp)

Color bleed post-process
  Ported/adapted from ReLite 0.7.4 color-bleed grade
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/ColorBleed.fp, Scripts/ColorBleedHandler.zs

Screen-M (widescreen pitch, phosphor / palette / CRT-style grading)
  Files: SHADERS/Widescreem.fp, WidescreemZ.fp, OldPals.fp, Temp*.fp,
         ScreeMHandler in zscript.zc, related CVARs/menus
  Temperature colour algorithms credit Tanner Helland (tannerhelland.com)

SoftShade (ordered dither / palette reduction)
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/SoftShade.fp, Scripts/SoftShadePostProcessHandler.zs

World gamma & bloom boost
  Files: SHADERS/WorldGamma.fp, BloomBoostPre.fp, BloomBoostPost.fp,
         WorldGammaHandler and BBHandler in zscript.zc

Tc post-process pack (lens flares, vignette toggle path, screen noise)
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/LensFlare.fp, Noise.fp, TcPostProcessShaderHandler
         in zscript.zc, tc_pp_* CVARs

Old video / aged-film defects shader
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/OldVideo.fp, OldVideoShaderHandler in zscript.zc

SDPWH screen effects (filmic LUT tonemap path, chromatic aberration, etc.)
  Files: SDPWHScreenEffects in zscript.zc, related shaders and TEXTURES LUTs

ACES tonemap
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/ACES.fp, ACESTonemapHandler in zscript.zc
  Implements standard ACES filmic approximations (Narkowicz / full RRT+ODT paths)

BodyCam Visual
  Original integration for this suite: MIT (section 1)
  Files: SHADERS/PostProcess/bodycam.fp, Scripts/SSSBodyCamHandler.zs
  Digital mode pairs with the fisheye shader; analog mode reuses VHS/CRT + fisheye

Environment / water / material shaders
  Files: SHADERS/env*.fp, water.fp, GLDEFS/materials_*.gl, MATERIALS/

Original RT-lite & enhanced lighting (this suite)
  Files: Scripts/SSSLightingHandler.zs, SSSRelightEnhance.zs, SSSDoorLightHandler.zs,
         SSSShadowHandler.zs, SSSReflectionHelper.zs, SSSVisualPresetHandler.zs,
         SHADERS/PostProcess/ContactAO.fp, FluidSSR.fp, GLDEFS/sss_colorizations.gl, etc.

Inspired by (not a port of the standalone mods; do not run alongside them)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Relighting (Nash Muhandes)
  RT-Relight Enhance, door-light spill, and wall-shadow ideas are
  Relighting-inspired, performance-tiered reimplementations.

ReLite (Hey Doomer, MIT)
  Enhanced lighting bias/bleed/colorization and ColorBleed.fp grade trace to
  ReLite 0.7.4 concepts. ReLite itself is a fork of Relighting.

Dark Doom (SidDoyle / Josh771)
  Conceptual predecessor to DarkDoomZ sector darkening.


